{"event_type":"finding-event","id":"3de91f4c606be01b9edb0ff2bf9ed2b84da8d12e32f8e5007d7f1bf84e9ecd18","occurred_at":"2026-11-17T20:07:28Z","payload":{"action":"confirmed","actor":"crq-triage/opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-flash","evidence":{"anchor_verified":true,"failure_class":"evidence","mapped_intervals":[[356,360]],"mapped_path":"src/policy/crq/reviewAdmission.ts","quoted_text":"  if (action === 'observed' && adequate(item) && !input.verifyReceipt(item)) {\n    result = withObjectKeys(result, [\n      ['next_action', 'resubmit'],\n      ['reason', 'receipt-unavailable'],\n    ]);","reason":"The admission queue persists the item and request binding, but the receipt-unavailable condition is attached only to the local response at lines 356-360. The later status projection uses reviewStatus and has no equivalent receipt check or persisted flag, so replaying the same request loses the resubmit instruction. This is an ordinary idempotent-replay correctness defect, not a new requirement.","target":"33ff78cef8138f7ae362d9ad03dc5ca60a7cc2c9"},"finding_id":"d799cc47e2aa464fa154022c0c3515e517be33c7602e6e9cfe6438a769831799","previous_event_id":null,"review_id":"19859068a56813567c6bec1dfeb03e9fbdf22d68ee5a99b882939cb2337191b5"},"schema":"cq.review-ledger/v1","source_key":"finding:d799cc47e2aa464fa154022c0c3515e517be33c7602e6e9cfe6438a769831799:ea89c3bab14da2e3bb317f420f1ab37963f231026ca291b22c81dc15b849ff56"}